+
+/**
+ * dsi_ctrl_config_clk_gating() - Enable/Disable DSI PHY clk gating
+ * @dsi_ctrl:        DSI controller handle.
+ * @enable:          Enable/disable DSI PHY clk gating
+ * @clk_selection:   clock selection for gating
