+ * @DSI_FIFO_UNDERFLOW:    DSI FIFO Underflow error
+ * @DSI_LP_Rx_TIMEOUT:     DSI LP/RX Timeout error
+ * @DSI_PLL_UNLOCK_ERR:	   DSI PLL unlock error
